s=3D"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"><mi>=CE=BB</mi></math></mjx-assist=
ive-mml></mjx-container> improves the optimal accuracy (SGD vs. SGD-WD, SGD=
M vs. SGDM-WD).</li>
<li>Introducing <mjx-container class=3D"MathJax CtxtMenu_Attached_0" jax=3D=
"CHTML" tabindex=3D"0" ctxtmenu_counter=3D"307" style=3D"font-size: 121.3%;=
